---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BackgroundVideo from "../components/BackgroundVideo.astro";
---

<Layout title="The Paddle House at Goose Hill | Washington, CT" current="home">
  {/* ───────────────────────────── HERO ───────────────────────────── */}
  <section class="relative min-h-[92vh] flex items-end overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 reveal-mask">
      <BackgroundVideo
        src="/paddle-house-pics/video/drone-estate.mp4"
        poster="/paddle-house-pics/drone-estate-poster.jpg"
        alt="The farmhouse and barn at Goose Hill, seen from the lawn as the view rises over the estate"
        parallax={14}
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/70 via-ink/35 to-ink/15"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 pb-24 md:pb-32 w-full">
      <p
        class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-parchment-warm/80 mb-6 reveal text-scrim"
      >
        Est. 1760 · Washington, Connecticut
      </p>
      <h1
        class="reveal-chars font-display text-parchment-warm text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-8xl leading-[1.02] tracking-tight max-w-5xl letterpress"
      >
        Old house. New memories.
      </h1>
      <p
        class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-parchment-warm/85 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-xl leading-relaxed"
      >
        An 18th-century farmhouse on thirteen quiet acres with a paddle court
        out back and every detail thoughtfully prepared to make you feel at
        home from the moment you arrive.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="/book"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-parchment text-ink px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-label text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide hover:bg-parchment-warm transition-colors"
        >
          Write to John &amp; Erin
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/experience"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-parchment-warm/40 text-parchment-warm px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-label text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide hover:bg-parchment-warm/10 transition-colors"
        >
          The Experience
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ─────────────────────── INVITATION STRIP ─────────────────────── */}
  <section class="paper bg-parchment py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <div class="reveal-mask aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden editorial-shadow">
          <img
            src="/paddle-house-pics/john-erin-oros-paddle-selfie-in-car.png"
            alt="John and Erin, paddles in hand"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover img-zoom"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-8">
        <p class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-patina mb-8 reveal">
          A note from the hosts
        </p>
        <p class="reveal-chars font-display italic text-2xl md:text-4xl leading-[1.25] text-ink mb-8">
          We fell in love with Goose Hill the moment we arrived.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-6 font-body text-ink/75 text-lg leading-relaxed reveal">
          <p>
            It wasn't just the historic farmhouse or the beauty of Washington Depot. It was the feeling. Life seems to slow down here, making room for connection, laughter, and time together.
          </p>
          <p>
            We've carefully preserved the home's character while adding the comforts we'd want for our own family and friends. Whether you're gathering your paddle crew, looking for a couples' getaway, or a family retreat, we hope you'll make yourselves at home and enjoy everything Goose Hill has to offer, from the pool and skating pond to the trails, paddle court, and peaceful surroundings.
          </p>
          <p>
            We hope you leave feeling as refreshed as we do every time we're here.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="reveal mt-10 font-body text-ink/70 text-lg italic">John &amp; Erin</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ─────────────────────── HOW THIS WORKS ─────────────────────── */}
  <section class="bg-parchment-warm py-20 md:py-28 paper">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 text-center">
      <p class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-copper mb-6 reveal">
        Not a listing
      </p>
      <h2 class="reveal-chars font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-ink mb-8">
        You won't find us on Airbnb. On purpose.
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 font-body text-ink/75 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <p>
          Goose Hill is our family's second home, and we intend to keep it
          feeling like one. So there's no instant-book button here. You write
          to us, we find dates that work for your group and for the house, and
          when you pull up the drive the whole place is yours.
        </p>
        <p>
          When you arrive, a code on the kitchen counter opens the guest
          portal: the house guide, the wifi, our favorite spots in town. The
          rest of the weekend belongs to you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ───────────────────────────── THE PLAY ───────────────────────── */}
  <section class="bg-parchment-deep py-24 md:py-32 paper">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-end mb-16">
        <div class="md:col-span-5">
          <p
            class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-moss mb-5 reveal"
          >
            The Play
          </p>
          <h2
            class="reveal-chars font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink"
          >
            A court that takes the weather personally.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
          <p class="reveal font-body text-ink/75 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Whether it's a crisp October morning, a snowy February afternoon,
            or a warm summer evening, the game is always on. Our regulation
            platform tennis court is lit, heated in winter, and stocked with
            paddles if you need them.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-mask rounded-sm overflow-hidden editorial-shadow aspect-[16/9]">
        <img
          src="/paddle-house-pics/court-night.jpg"
          alt="A doubles match underway on the lit platform tennis court at night"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover img-zoom"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ──────────────────────────── THE STAY ────────────────────────── */}
  <section class="bg-parchment py-24 md:py-32 paper">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-20">
        <p
          class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-copper mb-5 reveal"
        >
          The Stay
        </p>
        <h2
          class="reveal-chars font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink"
        >
          Rooms with stories to tell.
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal mt-6 font-body text-ink/70 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Six bedrooms in the main house and two more in the guest house
          provide space to gather without ever feeling crowded. Historic in
          character, thoughtfully updated, and designed for long weekends
          with people you love.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
        <a href="/accommodations" class="group reveal">
          <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden editorial-shadow mb-5 reveal-mask">
            <img
              src="/paddle-house-pics/barn-interior.jpg"
              alt="Inside the barn: basketball hoop, climbing wall, and a wide plank floor"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover img-zoom"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-patina mb-2">
            The Barn
          </p>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl text-ink group-hover:text-moss transition-colors">
            The kids will find it first.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a href="/accommodations" class="group reveal md:translate-y-12">
          <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden editorial-shadow mb-5 reveal-mask">
            <img
              src="/paddle-house-pics/grounds-kids.jpg"
              alt="Kids running up the lawn from the pool on a summer afternoon"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover img-zoom"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-patina mb-2">
            The Grounds
          </p>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl text-ink group-hover:text-moss transition-colors">
            A pond, a fire pit, a lawn you'll walk barefoot.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a href="/accommodations" class="group reveal">
          <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden editorial-shadow mb-5 reveal-mask">
            <BackgroundVideo
              src="/paddle-house-pics/video/pool-ripples.mp4"
              poster="/paddle-house-pics/pool-ripples-poster.jpg"
              alt="The pool in summer, wind rippling across the water, the barn beyond"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover img-zoom"
            />
          </div>
          <p class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-patina mb-2">
            The Pool
          </p>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl text-ink group-hover:text-moss transition-colors">
            Warm afternoons, the long way around.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ─────────────────────── GUEST WORDS ─────────────────────── */}
  <section class="bg-parchment-deep py-24 md:py-32 paper">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
        <p class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-copper mb-5 reveal">
          From past guests
        </p>
        <h2 class="reveal-chars font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink">
          Take their word for it.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <figure class="bg-parchment p-10 md:p-12 editorial-shadow reveal">
          <p class="font-display text-3xl text-copper leading-none mb-6" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</p>
          <blockquote class="font-body text-ink/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            A property with something for everyone in our group. From babies to
            adults there was fun for everyone, more than enough beds and
            bathrooms, and practically any item you could think of you might
            need. We would love to return here one day.
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-ink/55">
            Julia · Family stay, July 2026
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bg-parchment p-10 md:p-12 editorial-shadow reveal md:translate-y-8">
          <p class="font-display text-3xl text-copper leading-none mb-6" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</p>
          <blockquote class="font-body text-ink/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            The basketball court and paddle court were a big hit. Erin and John
            as hosts are even better. They were very communicative and very
            thoughtful. 10/10 would recommend to everyone.
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-ink/55">
            Louis · Group trip, May 2026
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ────────────────────────── CTA ────────────────────────── */}
  <section class="bg-moss-dark text-parchment-warm py-28 md:py-36 paper">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 text-center">
      <p class="font-label text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-parchment-warm/60 mb-6 reveal">
        Plan your weekend
      </p>
      <h2 class="reveal-chars font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">
        Pull up the drive. Make yourself at home.
      </h2>
      <div class="reveal mt-10">
        <a
          href="/book"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-parchment text-ink px-9 py-4 rounded-full font-label text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide hover:bg-parchment-warm transition-colors"
        >
          Write to John &amp; Erin
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
